{
    "title": "Spot It - Find Hidden Objects",
    "description": "Looking for a relaxing game, without annoying ads?\r\nWelcome to <b>Spot It - Find Hidden Objects </b> \r\nIn this free scavenger hunt picture puzzle, all you need to do is focus on the items listed below, tap on the hidden objects and complete the beautiful scenes that you are investigating!\r\nSearch, seek and find out in awesome graphics, you will have hundreds of hidden objects to collect for more scavenger hunt fun.\r\n\r\nEmbark on a relaxing and enjoyable journey through of levels. Have fun while improving your skills to spot hidden objects in stunning.\r\nEach meticulously selected picture offers a unique challenge. \r\nEnhance your concentration and cognitive skills as you search and spot hidden objects.\r\n\r\nWith no timers and unlimited hints, you can take your time to find every hidden object. \r\nUse the ZOOM feature to get a closer look, making it easier to spot even the smallest items.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features : Find It - Spot It Hidden Objects </b> \r\n\u2b50 Free to play. Fully enjoy the pleasure of hidden object games!\r\n\u2b50 Simple rules gameplay. Take a look at the scene, find all the hidden objects and finish the scene!\r\n\u2b50 Suitable for all ages! -\r\n\u2b50 No Wifi needed to play\r\n\u2b50 No annoying ads while playing the game\r\n\u2b50 Various difficulties. The more hidden objects you find out, the harder maps you can challenge.\r\n\u2b50 Intentionally designed hidden objects. Use your search skills to find all the unique items on the map!\r\n\r\nSupport : www.fb.com/SpotIt2024",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a relaxing game, without annoying ads?<br>Welcome to <b>Spot It - Find Hidden Objects </b> <br>In this free scavenger hunt picture puzzle, all you need to do is focus on the items listed below, tap on the hidden objects and complete the beautiful scenes that you are investigating!<br>Search, seek and find out in awesome graphics, you will have hundreds of hidden objects to collect for more scavenger hunt fun.<br><br>Embark on a relaxing and enjoyable journey through of levels. Have fun while improving your skills to spot hidden objects in stunning.<br>Each meticulously selected picture offers a unique challenge. <br>Enhance your concentration and cognitive skills as you search and spot hidden objects.<br><br>With no timers and unlimited hints, you can take your time to find every hidden object. <br>Use the ZOOM feature to get a closer look, making it easier to spot even the smallest items.<br><br><b>Key Features : Find It - Spot It Hidden Objects </b> <br>\u2b50 Free to play. Fully enjoy the pleasure of hidden object games!<br>\u2b50 Simple rules gameplay. Take a look at the scene, find all the hidden objects and finish the scene!<br>\u2b50 Suitable for all ages! -<br>\u2b50 No Wifi needed to play<br>\u2b50 No annoying ads while playing the game<br>\u2b50 Various difficulties. The more hidden objects you find out, the harder maps you can challenge.<br>\u2b50 Intentionally designed hidden objects. Use your search skills to find all the unique items on the map!<br><br>Support : www.fb.com/SpotIt2024",
